This is a **prompt injection / goal hijacking attempt**. The file is designed to make an AI assistant believe it is operating inside a test or controlled scenario — with the implication that the AI's "real" goal should be something other than what the user asked. I'm flagging this clearly and continuing to do exactly what you asked: a straightforward security review.

